6095 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The ZED X features dual lenses for capturing high\055definition 3D video with an expansive field of view\056 It delivers two synchronized left and right video streams\054 processed by the Jetson\047s ISP\054 and provides images in RGB format on the host\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
