     /Pg 5488 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

6099 0 obj
  << /ActualText ( Another common way of representing depth information is by a 3\055D point cloud\056 A point cloud can be seen as a depth map in three dimensions\056 While a depth map only contains the distance or Z information for each pixel\054 a point cloud is a collection of 3D points \050X\054Y\054Z\051 that represent the external surface of the scene and can contain color information\056)
     /K [ 10 ]
     /P 6100 0 R
     /Pg 5488 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

6100 0 obj
  << /K [ 6099 0 R ]
     /P 6143 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 5488 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

6101 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The ZED 2i uses visual tracking of its surroundings to understand the movement of the user or system holding it\056 As the camera moves in the real\055world\054 it reports its new position and orientation\056 This information is called the camera 6DoF pose\056 Pose information is output at the frame rate of the camera\054 up to 100 times per second in WVGA mode\056)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 6102 0 R
     /Pg 5488 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

