     /S /P
     /Pg 5488 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

6111 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Object detection is the ability to identify objects present in an image\056 Thanks to depth sensing and 3D information\054 the ZED camera is able to provide the 2D and 3D position of the objects in the scene\056Since ZED SDK 3\0566\054 a custom detector can be used with the API\056 The 2D detection are ingested and 3D informations such as position\054 3D bounding box and more are computed\056 More informations in the Custom Detector page)
     /K [ 16 ]
     /P 6112 0 R
     /Pg 5488 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

