6113 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Body tracking module focuses on skeleton bone detection and tracking\056 A detected bone is represented by its two end points also called keypoints\056 The ZED camera provides 2D and 3D information for each keypoint as well as local rotation\056 The ZED SDK supports four body formats\072 18 or 34\054 38 keypoints\056)
     /K [ 17 ]
     /P 6114 0 R
     /Pg 5488 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
